---
/**
 * Privacy note — served at /privacy/
 *
 * The contact form collects names, emails, and free text, which is personal data.
 * docs/deploy-pipeline.md flags this as something to decide early; this page is the
 * placeholder for that decision. Have someone who can actually speak for the group
 * review the wording before launch.
 */
import BaseLayout from '~/layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy"
  description="What CSEED does with the information you send through this site."
>
  <div class="wrap prose body">
    <h1>Privacy</h1>

    <p>
      <strong>Placeholder — needs review before launch.</strong> The specifics below are unconfirmed defaults,
      not an agreed policy.
    </p>

    <h2>What we collect</h2>
    <p>
      If you use the contact form, we store the name, email address, and message you submit, along
      with the time you sent it. Nothing else is collected — there is no analytics or advertising on
      this site.
    </p>

    <h2>Why</h2>
    <p>So we can read your message and reply to it. That is the only use.</p>

    <h2>How long we keep it</h2>
    <p>TODO: agree a retention period, and who on the team can read submissions.</p>

    <h2>Spam protection</h2>
    <p>
      Form submissions are checked by Cloudflare Turnstile, which receives your IP address as part
      of that check.
    </p>

    <h2>Removing your data</h2>
    <p>Email <a href="mailto:cseed@example.edu">cseed@example.edu</a> and we will delete it.</p>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .body {
    padding-block: var(--space-xl);
  }

  h2 {
    margin-top: var(--space-lg);
  }
</style>
